Subject: [PATCH 164/191] [ae-patch] Pick a roles preset per session from the
 dialog, the composer pill, Alt 1 to 9 or a START ON line

The "Who works on this?" dialog gets a Roles preset row (chips, role summary, Customize for this session, Save as preset). A pill beside the model picker switches presets, Alt+digit in the composer picks by list position, and a START ON line in a session's first message sets the preset or the model and effort before the first turn, with Undo, behind a new Settings > Roles switch. Every ae.team label writer now keeps the roles field. The Settings preset row shows as many presets as fit its measured width.
